# Ink deploy canary. Claude rewrites this file after a substantial change; InkWatch (scripts\ink-watch.ps1)
# notices the new modification time and runs scripts\ink-push.ps1: commit + push, Firestore rules, Worker.
# subject: becomes the commit subject; everything after body: becomes the commit body.
last_tick: 2026-09-14T15:05:00Z
subject: Worker: name the query and route in Firestore errors; build stamp on /health
body:
- Firestore query failures now say which collection/filters/order produced them and which route was running
- /health reports the build stamp so a stale deploy is obvious
- ink-push: rules failure no longer blocks the Worker deploy
